    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience mazes like never before! Maze Engine delivers an unparalleled variety of procedurally generated labyrinthine experiences. Switch between intense first-person chases, strategic top-down navigation, immersive third-person adventures, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a constant stream of community-made content from the Steam Workshop, <strong>free for everyone to download and play!</strong> Ready to become a maze master yourself? Unleash your inner architect with the Level Editor DLC (sold separately) and share your creations with the world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience mazes like never before! Maze Engine delivers an unparalleled variety of procedurally generated labyrinthine experiences. Switch between intense first-person chases, strategic top-down navigation, immersive third-person adventures, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a constant stream of community-made content from the Steam Workshop, <strong>free for everyone to download and play!</strong> Ready to become a maze master yourself? Unleash your inner architect with the Level Editor DLC (sold separately) and share your creations with the world.</p>",
    "short_description": "Maze Engine: Experience a deep universe of maze games in first person, top down, and third person perspectives within a plethora of game-modes. Download endless free community maps from Steam Workshop. Level Editor DLC also available.",
